X	library-logs	p	Leave `/Library/Logs` and `/private/var/log` to macOS unless one file there has run away; then remove that file in Finder once you’ve dealt with whatever writes it. Don’t try to clear the unified log: Apple says that when its store passes a set size, macOS purges the oldest messages to make room.
