X	assetsv2	p	**No.** AssetsV2 is where macOS keeps parts it downloads after it’s installed: Apple Intelligence and Siri models, voices, dictionaries, fonts, security data and software updates on their way in. System Integrity Protection guards it, and macOS fetches what it needs again.
X	assetsv2	p	**What frees space instead:** turning off features you don’t use, installing updates that are waiting, and clearing what’s yours elsewhere on the Mac.
X	assetsv2	p	**Does it come back?** Yes. macOS manages what’s in it, adding and replacing assets as features and updates need them.
