X	assetsv2	li	1. **Turn off what you don’t use.** On macOS 15 and 26, turning off Apple Intelligence in System Settings › Apple Intelligence & Siri removes its models. macOS 27 has no single switch: what does and doesn’t free space there.
X	assetsv2	li	2. **Install waiting updates.** If Software Update says an update has downloaded, install it rather than hunting for its files.
X	assetsv2	li	3. **Free space where you’re in charge:** old iPhone backups, macOS installers and app caches.
