X	deleted-users	li	3. If you’re not sure, keep a copy of the whole image on an external drive before going further.
X	deleted-users	li	4. Eject the image, then drag it to the Trash. Finder asks for an administrator’s name and password.
X	deleted-users	li	5. Empty the Trash to get the space back.
