X	iphone-software-updates	li	3. Or open the folder in Finder, drag the `.ipsw` files to the Trash and empty it.
X	iphone-software-updates	p	Leave the backups in `~/Library/Application Support/MobileSync/Backup` alone unless you mean to delete one: that’s a separate choice, with no undo.
