X	quicklook-thumbnail-cache	li	1. Open Terminal (in Applications › Utilities).
X	quicklook-thumbnail-cache	li	2. Run `qlmanage -r cache`. It resets the thumbnail cache for your account, with no password to enter and no restart needed.
X	quicklook-thumbnail-cache	li	3. If previews of one kind of file look broken as well, also run `qlmanage -r`, which reloads Quick Look’s list of generators.
X	quicklook-thumbnail-cache	code	qlmanage -r cache
X	quicklook-thumbnail-cache	p	Don’t go into `/private/var/folders` and delete things by hand. Besides this cache, that folder holds other apps’ temporary files and caches that are in use right now.
