X	trash	p	**Yes, once you’ve looked through it.** Everything in the Trash is something you already chose to delete, and emptying it is what actually gives the space back.
X	trash	p	**What it costs you:** your last easy way back. Until then, File › Put Back returns an item to where it was; afterwards, Apple says, emptied items are permanently deleted.
X	trash	p	**Does it come back?** No. Only a backup made before can bring an emptied item back. The Trash itself fills up again as you delete things.
