X	photos-library	p	**No, not the library itself.** `Photos Library.photoslibrary` is every photo and video in the Photos app, with your albums and edits. Deleting it, or files inside it, can lose pictures that exist nowhere else.
X	photos-library	p	**What shrinking it properly costs:** with iCloud Photos, little more than download time, because Optimize Mac Storage keeps the full-size originals in iCloud. Without it, only the photos you choose to delete.
X	photos-library	p	**Does it come back?** Photos you delete in Photos wait 30 days in Recently Deleted. A library deleted in Finder comes back only from a backup; with iCloud Photos, what had finished uploading is still in iCloud.
