X	colima-lima-orbstack	p	**Only on purpose.** These folders are virtual machines. Inside them are your containers, images and volumes, and volumes can hold databases that exist nowhere else.
X	colima-lima-orbstack	p	**What it costs you:** images can be pulled or built again. Volume data cannot.
X	colima-lima-orbstack	p	**Does it come back?** The tool creates a fresh, empty VM next time it starts. Usually the better move is to prune inside the VM and delete nothing.
