X	ruby-gems-and-rbenv	code	du -sh ~/.gem ~/.rbenv/versions/* 2>/dev/null | sort -h
X	ruby-gems-and-rbenv	h	How to clear it
X	ruby-gems-and-rbenv	h3	Old gem versions
X	ruby-gems-and-rbenv	p	`gem cleanup` removes old versions of gems from `GEM_HOME` that aren’t required to meet a dependency. Preview first with `--dry-run`, which lists what would go without uninstalling anything. Add `--user-install` to clean the gems in your home directory instead of `GEM_HOME`.
