X	flutter-pub-cache	p	**Yes.** It’s pub’s system cache of packages downloaded for your Dart and Flutter projects. Clearing it also removes tools you activated with `dart pub global activate`, so note those first.
X	flutter-pub-cache	p	**What it costs you:** each project needs `flutter pub get` (or `dart pub get`) again before it builds.
X	flutter-pub-cache	p	**Does it come back?** Yes, package by package, as projects fetch them.
X	flutter-pub-cache	h	Measure it
