X	flutter-pub-cache	li	3. Clear the cache. Pub asks first, warning that everything inside will go and that you’ll have to run `pub get` again in each project; `--force` skips the question.
X	flutter-pub-cache	code	dart pub global list
X	flutter-pub-cache	code	flutter pub cache clean
X	flutter-pub-cache	p	`flutter pub cache clean` and `dart pub cache clean` do the same thing, since `flutter pub` runs Dart’s pub. `dart pub cache repair` is different: it reinstalls every package in the cache and frees nothing.
X	flutter-pub-cache	h3	Build folders in projects
