X	maven-repository	p	**Mostly.** Nearly everything in it is libraries and plugins Maven downloaded, and those come back on the next build. The exceptions are your own modules put there by `mvn install`, and the settings file next to it.
X	maven-repository	p	**What it costs you:** the next build downloads every dependency and plugin again, and projects that use your own locally installed modules need those rebuilt first.
