t PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX=\"$HOME/Library/Caches/pycache\"\n```","clear_commands":["cd ~/Projects/my-app\nfind . -type d -name __pycache__ -prune -exec rm -rf {} +","export PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX=\"$HOME/Library/Caches/pycache\""],"sources":[{"title":"Python tutorial: compiled Python files","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/modules.html#compiled-python-files"},{"title":"Python docs: command line and environment (-B, PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE, PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX)","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/using/cmdline.html"}],"see_also":["python-venv","pip-cache","uv-cache","pytest-mypy-tox-caches"],"match":[{"glob":"**/__pycache__"}],"url":"https://siftmac.com/safe-to-delete/pycache","markdown_url":"https://siftmac.com/safe-to-delete/pycache.md","published":"2026-11-21","updated":"2026-11-27"}
